sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Alice
    actor B as Bob
    A->>+B: Hello Bob, how are you?
    B-->>-A: Great!
    Note over A,B: A typical interaction
    loop Every minute
        A-)B: ping
    end
    alt ok
        B->>B: think
    else fail
        B--xA: error
    end
    Note right of B: done
